  "introBadge": "OWELL Industrial",
  "introTitle": {
    "en": "Your Trusted LED Lighting Partner",
    "zh": "",
    "es": "",
    "ja": ""
  },
  "introParagraphs": [
    {
      "id": "ip1",
      "text": {
        "en": "Jiujiang Ouwei Industrial Co., Ltd. was established in 2012. The company has been engaged in the research, development, production, and sales of motion-sensor lights, including outdoor motion-sensor lights, motion-sensor lights for security cameras, dry-cell motion-sensor lights, solar-powered motion-sensor lights, hybrid motion-sensor lights, work lights, and smart streetlight systems. (The company’s products are known for their consistent quality and have held an 85% market share in Japan for 10 consecutive years.)",
        "zh": "",
        "es": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "order": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "ip2",
      "text": {
        "en": "The company currently occupies a site area of 3,900 square meters, with a factory building area of approximately 40,000 square meters. It employs over 400 staff members, including 30 technical personnel and 24 quality control (QC) staff. The company has a total of eight production workshops: die-casting, injection molding, metalworking, rubber, painting, assembly, and SMT.",
        "zh": "",
        "es": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "order": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "ip_1789277459423_7msv",
      "text": {
        "en": "The company has nine comprehensive departments: R&D, Technical Projects, Quality Control, Production, Purchasing, Warehousing, Administration, and Sales. The company has obtained ISO 9001:2015 international quality management system certification, and most of our products have received international safety certifications such as ETL, CE, and PSE.",
        "zh": "",
        "es": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "order": 3
    },
    {
      "id": "ip_1789277468255_ov91",
      "text": {
        "en": "Adhering to the business philosophy of “Work hard, strive for excellence, pursue top-notch quality, and create a world-class brand,” the company has experienced rapid growth. As a professional manufacturer and exporter of motion-sensor lights, we export our products worldwide. Quality first and integrity-based are our core principles; your satisfaction is our ultimate goal. We welcome inquiries and cooperation from partners both domestically and internationally, and we are committed to providing you with the highest quality service!",
        "zh": "",
        "es": "",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "order": 4
    }
  ],
